  "Name": "PICKZONE_LOC_ITEM",
  "Description": "PICK ZONE - LOCATION_ITEM\n\nTrackingEntity is LOC_ITEM\nImplements Zone picking where a step is available for LocationZone\nScanner only show the next item to pick, not all items\nImplements a Qty button selector avoiding keyboard switching from Alphanumeric to Numeric\nAlso implements a SKIP to next line since we only show 1 line\n\nZones are implemented as Location Categories.  In FIFOPickRecommendation, the Zone is added to the Instruction with a separator.   In the process the step LocationZone fetches the available Zones and summaries this, for selection\nIt implements a SKIP on showing the next line to pick using LinePriority -if SKIP is entered on Qty, then it sets line priority to 99999 so that the skipped line is at bottom of list.\nThis only happens on the Skip - where I pass in a bit to FIFOPickInstruction indicating whether to update linepriorities that are set to 99999.  We only do this when calling from the Document Step, Not on Step200 - this allows us to maintain the LinePriority as 99999, unless I restart picking.  FIFOPickrecommendation is included in this publish",
